<div id="StoneStories"><div class="gifting-body"><section class="block-1 my-first-sect fade fadeOut fade-effect"><img src="./slider3_files/unscripted_bg.jpg" alt="" class="my-first-banner"><div class="my-first-text my-first-text-absolute">Unscripted Stories</div><div class="down_arrow arrow-position bounce"><img src="./slider3_files/down_arrow.png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></section><section class="my-first-text-sec fade fadeOut fade-effect2"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="my-first-text mb-3">Unscripted Stories</div><div class="unscripted-phara">From beautiful contradictions to lyrical juxtapositions - every precious moment personifies her inner beauty and uninhibited pride. Each step of her journey hits like a wave. And each wave is a story that fuels her journey. What she feels through these markers - defines the breathtaking marvel that she is. She celebrates every memory, every smile and every sigh as a moment of glory. This is her moment to shine. This is the power of her story.<div class="down_arrow mx-auto mt-4 bounce"><img src="./slider3_files/down_arrow(1).png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></div></div></section><section class="compassion-bg unscripted-product-bg"><div class="container-fluid aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-easing="linear" data-aos-duration="1000"><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="my-first-text mb-3 text-left">Compassion</div><div class="my-first-phara text-left m-0 compassion-text">Those times where only she seems to understand are uncanny. She always knows what to say and when to say it. Her inherent need to empathise, sympathise and nurture - eternally promote prosperity and a clear conscience.<a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#" class="product-anchor emreald-text"> EMERALD</a></div></div></div><div class="down_arrow mx-auto mt-5 bounce"><img src="./slider3_files/down_arrow.png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></div></section><section class="gifting-collection padding120 block-2"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/finger-ring-zlhw18fabaa34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/effel-ring2+1.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Art Deco Emerald Ring</div></a></div></div><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/hoop-earring-zlhw18hakaaa34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+141.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Emerald and Diamond Braid Earrings</div></a></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/hoop-earring-zlka17hamaba34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+142.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Green Apple Earrings</div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="artistry-bg unscripted-product-bg  block-3"><div class="container-fluid aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-easing="linear" data-aos-duration="1000"><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="my-first-text mb-3 text-left">Artistry</div><div class="my-first-phara text-left m-0 artistry-text">She finds inspiration in many forms and in the simple things. She breaks the mould and yet remains spellbindingly unchanged. She is enveloped by art and every marker on her journey is a pure and poetic reflection of her soul.<a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#" class="product-anchor ruby-text"> RUBY</a></div></div></div><div class="down_arrow mx-auto mt-5 bounce"><img src="./slider3_files/down_arrow.png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></div></section><section class="gifting-collection padding120 block-4"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/finger-ring-zlhw18fbjaa34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+143.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Ruby Floral Ring</div></a></div></div><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+144.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Tulip Ruby Bangle</div></a></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/finger-ring-zlit18fagaa34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+145.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Roman Forum Ruby Ring</div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="amethyst-bg unscripted-product-bg  block-5"><div class="container-fluid aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-easing="linear" data-aos-duration="1000"><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="my-first-text mb-3 text-left">Balance</div><div class="my-first-phara text-left m-0 artistry-text">Her calming and compelling aura transcends all norms. Her poise and power of expression set her free and dissolve any trace of negativity. She prides herself for always finding a way, for always carrying on with poise.<a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#" class="product-anchor amethyst-text"> AMETHYST</a></div></div></div><div class="down_arrow mx-auto mt-5 bounce"><img src="./slider3_files/down_arrow.png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></div></section><section class="gifting-collection padding120 block-6"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/drop-earring-zlit18dbhaba34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+158.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Florence Baptistery Earrings</div></a></div></div><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/finger-ring-zlit18fanaa34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+160.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Rialto Bridge Amethyst Ring</div></a></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/chain-pendant-zlgm19gceaa34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+159.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Tryst with Amethyst Pendant</div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="tanzanite-bg unscripted-product-bg  block-7"><div class="container-fluid aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-easing="linear" data-aos-duration="1000"><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="my-first-text mb-3 text-left">Strength</div><div class="my-first-phara text-left m-0 artistry-text">Those flashes of bravery and resilience, as her endurance conquered fear of the unknown are unforgettable. Her courage and transformation have set the tone for a healthy relationship and brought openness to new possibilities.<a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#" class="product-anchor tanzanite-text"> TANZANITE</a></div></div></div><div class="down_arrow mx-auto mt-5 bounce"><img src="./slider3_files/down_arrow.png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></div></section><section class="gifting-collection padding120 block-8"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+162.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Tryst with Amethyst Pendant</div></a></div></div><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/bangles-zlit18vat1a34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+164.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Pantheon Dome Window Tanzanite Bangle</div></a></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5"><a href="https://www.zoya.in/product/finger-ring-zlpr17falab34"><div class="gifting-collection-main"><img src="./slider3_files/image+163.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">Eiffel Tower Ring</div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="sapphire-bg unscripted-product-bg  block-9"><div class="container-fluid aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-easing="linear" data-aos-duration="1000"><div class="row justify-content-end"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="my-first-text mb-3 text-left">Love</div><div class="my-first-phara text-left m-0 artistry-text">A feeling of warmth takes over as she prioritises her well-being. This is her moment to revel in building her paradise. This is her own sweet symphony. She understands that no one will truly know her the way she knows herself.<a href="https://www.zoya.in/wps/portal/zoya/zoyaroot/stone-stories/!ut/p/z1/04_Sj9CPykssy0xPLMnMz0vMAfIjo8ziTS0MjDydDYz8DAzdDA0Cwwz8LUxCTUzNXMz0w8EK_ALdjdw9nA383P0NLQwCDXwDQj1c_QwNnU30o4jRb4ADOBoQpx-Pgij8xofrR4GV4PMBITMKckNDIwwyHQGXSbXI/#" class="product-anchor sapphire-text"> YELLOW SAPPHIRE</a></div></div></div><div class="down_arrow mx-auto mt-5 bounce"