<div id="CT_Footer_Menu"><footer class=" "><div class="container-fluid p-0"><button class="know-more-sec" id="know-more" style="display: block;">Know More</button></div><div class="padding10"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="know-dec collapse hide" id="collapseExample"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-6 know-padd-right know-padd-left"><h3 class="know-more-dec-heading"> A World of Inspiration</h3><p class="know-more-dec-text">Welcome to an enchanted world where inspirations from around the world come together and come to life.Ancient cultures, a forgotten relic, a sensual dance, an exotic fabric, a sudden burst of rain – all capture the very soul of each inspiration with expert craftsmanship and immortalizes them in fine designs of gold, diamond and precious stones.Zoya is not merely a jewellery store, but an exclusive gallery of fine art, where each exquisitely crafted piece is a souvenir of Zoya’s journey – and where discerning customers can share in the history of these remarkable pieces.Zoya is a chain of luxury diamond boutiques from the House of Tata. It is one of three brands of the jewellery division of Titan Company Limited. It is both a product and a retail brand and is created for the design-seeking woman with an international sensibility.</p></div><div class="col-md-6 know-padd-right know-padd-left"><h3 class="know-more-dec-heading"> Explore our wide range Diamond Jewellery Designs from the comfort of home</h3><p class="know-more-dec-text">“Earrings &gt;  Diamond Earrings | Platinum Earrings Pendants &gt;  Diamond Pendants | Platinum Pendants Finger Rings &gt; Diamond Rings | Platinum Pendants Bangles &gt;  Diamond Bangles | Platinum Bangles Chains &gt;  Diamond Chains | Platinum Chains Neckwear &gt; Diamond Neckwear | Platinum Neckwear <br> Bracelets &gt; Diamond Bracelets | Platinum Bracelets Pendants &gt; Diamond Pendants | Platinum Pendants <br> Neckwear with Earrings &gt; Diamond Neckwear with Earrings | Platinum Neckwear with Earrings Pendant with Earrings &gt;  Diamond Pendant with Earrings | Platinum Pendant with Earrings Pendant with Chains &gt;  Diamond Pendant with Chains </p></div></div><div class="row mt-5"><div class="col-md-12"><h3 class="know-more-dec-heading"></h3><p class="know-more-dec-text"></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container-fluid padding120"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12  col-lg-2 my-auto"><div class="footer-logo"><img src="./slider3_files/zoya-footer-logo.png" alt="" class="img-fluid"></div></div><div class="col-md-7 col-lg-7"><div class="foo-heading">Sitemap</div><ul class="sitemap-list"><li><a class="active" id="scrollSection1">Home</a></li><li><a href="https://www.zoya.in/bespoke">Bespoke</a></li><li><a href="https://www.zoya.in/myaccount/home">My Zoya</a></li></ul><ul class="sitemap-list second-col"><li><a href="https://www.zoya.in/shop/view-all">Shop</a></li><li><a class="zoya_galleries" href="https://www.zoya.in/galleries"> ZOYA Galleries</a> </li><li><a href="https://www.zoya.in/gifting-home"> Gifting </a> </li><li id="book-appointment"><a>Book an appointment</a></li></ul><ul class="sitemap-list"><li><a href="https://www.zoya.in/terms-and-condition">Help</a></li><li><a class="wishlist" href="https://www.zoya.in/myaccount/home/wishlist"> Wishlist </a> </li><li><a href="https://www.zoya.in/experience"> Reach Us</a></li></ul></div><div class="col-md-5  col-lg-3"><div class="foo-heading mb-1 boldtext">Join Our Emailing List</div><form class="Signup__form" id="newsletter"><input id="subscriptionemail" type="email" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter your email"><button form="newsletter" class="Signup__button" id="emailsubmit" type="submit"><img src="./slider3_files/emailer-btn.svg" alt=""></button></form><div class="foo-heading mt-4">Connect With Zoya</div><ul class="social-media-icons"><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/zoyajewels/" target="_blank" s=""><img src="./slider3_files/instagram.svg" alt=""></a></li><li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/ZoyaJewels" target="_blank"><img src="./slider3_files/facebook.svg" alt=""></a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/zoya-a-tata-product/" target="_blank"><img src="./slider3_files/linkedin.svg" alt=""></a></li><li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdaOC7iQe2ztX9ivTeu5G3A" target="_blank"><img src="./slider3_files/youtube.svg" alt=""></a></li><li><a href="https://wa.link/cqpce8" target="_blank"><img src="./slider3_files/whatsapp.svg" alt=""></a></li></ul></div></div></div></footer></div>
